Read `AGENTS.md` in the project root before doing anything. It is the source of truth for the working agreement, conventions, glossary, and forbidden edits.

Before writing anything, identify which role you are operating in (Architect / Developer / Reviewer) per `AGENTS.md` under "Your role", and read the matching file under `.agent-team/roles/`. If the user has not specified a role, ask and do not default.
